    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO BERRYVILLE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OH NO! The town of Berryville is in dire need of help! This town of bears needs a crafty entrepreneur to help get them out of financial hardship and recover from a bad storm! <strong>Can you help?</strong>\u00a0You will only have a short amount of time to get to financial success before you lose everything and the town goes to ruin. <br><br><strong>Wait! Don\u2019t worry!</strong>\u00a0<strong>You have the help of the Four Money Bears!</strong> These cute financial partners will help guide you to learn to manage money. With the support of Spender, Saver, Investor and Giver bear you'll be able to make your financial dreams come true and maybe even learn something along the way!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454190/extras/8d3d598348d5b7f2d2ab8a2c24601f2a.poster.avif?t=1749495314\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454190/extras/8d3d598348d5b7f2d2ab8a2c24601f2a.webm?t=1749495314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454190/extras/8d3d598348d5b7f2d2ab8a2c24601f2a.mp4?t=1749495314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>BECOME THE BEST MERCHANT.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you become the biggest merchant in the world? You'll have to beat the competition and manage your money wisely. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use all the town's resources at your disposal and unlock and craft tons of recipes.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454190/extras/035af31a5ddb3871929917ec08c7352b.poster.avif?t=1749495314\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454190/extras/035af31a5ddb3871929917ec08c7352b.webm?t=1749495314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454190/extras/035af31a5ddb3871929917ec08c7352b.mp4?t=1749495314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE ALL THE MONIES.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You will surely have to make all the monies to pay off your loan. Haggle with customers or improve your relationship with them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the berry stock market and guess when prices will sky rocket or drop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests to improve your financial scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn tips and tricks on how to be successful!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454190/extras/40669294eea89f5ef44f627809930bfe.poster.avif?t=1749495314\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454190/extras/40669294eea89f5ef44f627809930bfe.webm?t=1749495314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454190/extras/40669294eea89f5ef44f627809930bfe.mp4?t=1749495314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Business and Financial Basics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive Off the Land by Fishing, Mining, and Collecting Resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire Farmers to Grow Many Varieties of Berry Crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and find treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help your community by helping others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress and see your growth!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the award winning children's book.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Is this an educational game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes! We're not hiding that Berryville will teach kids around a 5th grade reading level about money management. What is hidden is the education, we integrated it so deeply that the core game loop is about learning how to manage money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they say ~ the best way to learn is by doing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BACKED BY CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNERS.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re looking for a fun cozy business sim,<strong> this is for you.\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re looking for your child to learn money management at a basic core level, <strong>this is for you.</strong></p></li></ul>",
