re_item_assets/steam/apps/3454190/extras/035af31a5ddb3871929917ec08c7352b.poster.avif?t=1749495314\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454190/extras/035af31a5ddb3871929917ec08c7352b.webm?t=1749495314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454190/extras/035af31a5ddb3871929917ec08c7352b.mp4?t=1749495314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE ALL THE MONIES.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You will surely have to make all the monies to pay off your loan. Haggle with customers or improve your relationship with them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the berry stock market and guess when prices will sky rocket or drop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests to improve your financial scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn tips and tricks on how to be successful!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454190/extras/40669294eea89f5ef44f627809930bfe.poster.avif?t=1749495314\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454190/extras/40669294eea89f5ef44f627809930bfe.webm?t=1749495314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454190/extras/40669294eea89f5ef44f627809930bfe.mp4?t=1749495314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Business and Financial Basics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive Off the Land by Fishing, Mining, and Collecting Resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire Farmers to Grow Many Varieties of Berry Crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and find treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help your community by helping others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress and see your growth!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the award winning children's book.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Is this an educational game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes! We're not hiding that Berryville will teach kids around a 5th grade reading level about money management. What is hidden is the education, we integrated it so deeply that the core game loop is about learning how to manage money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they say ~ the best way to learn is by doing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BACKED BY CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNERS.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re looking for a fun cozy business sim,<strong> this is for you.\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re looking for your child to learn money management at a basic core level, <strong>this is for you.</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Learn to Make Millions in this Cozy Merchant Sim. Build a business and beat the competition to become the biggest merchant in the world by learning smart financial habits, behaviors and traits. Craft pies &amp; jams from tons of different berries. Have fun running your shop &amp; helping your community!",
